      "id": "G4-GLOBAL",
      "prior_boundary": "Accepted actual_no_loss_append still requires hq; the0007 note had no assembled actual original-span discharge.",
      "current_source_only_discharge": "f24e actual_original_span_no_loss derives hq on supported no-loss intermediate states. Endpoint-typed OriginalSpan plus accepted actual_original_span_exit_population places all live owners at the suffix entrance; live count equality is the hq branch condition; accepted actual_program_register_support preserves the full original bank. The suffix induction hypothesis supplies the same scalar before applying accepted actual_no_loss_append. No entering-singleton, fresh seed or abstract homogeneity assumption is added.",
      "remaining": "Actual kernel elaboration/full ownership audit of both new drafts; supplied original span/source admission and calibrated final-topology decoder remain explicit. Forest cardinality is a marginal, not a reconstruction of full hidden rows. Unknown rival prefix provenance, biased global head entry and passive full-law Z_T are not discharged."
    },
    {
      "id": "G6-COMMON-EXPOSURE",
